ssion_role":"plan","bead_id":"bob-cli-kq.1","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-kq[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Security and bug audit fixes[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]The 19 verified findings from the five-area security/bug audit of [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]bob-cli are fixed with regression tests: git pathspec globbing can [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]no longer revert the wrong vault file, calendar titles can no [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]longer inject tags/links, the web clipper's private- network guard [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]holds across redirects and WebSockets, vault writes are guarded and[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]crash-durable, and the small verified defects are corrected.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]1[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] wave[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]security_audit_fixes_1.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/security_audit_fixes_1.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-kq[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-kq/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Literal git pathspecs for vault filenames[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]git-literal-pathspecs[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]git-literal-pathspecs: switch the highlights_ref recovery/mutation and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]collect_done git call sites that pass concrete vault filenames from [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]ob::git_command to ob::git_command_literal, reject pathspec magic in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]recovery's validated_paths, and add glob-filename regression tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Gcal remote-text trust boundary[/bold #D7AFFF]                               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]gcal-title-hardening[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]gcal-title-hardening: extend gcal escape_title to neutralize mid-line [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tags, wikilinks, and Markdown links in organizer-authored event titles; [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fix the gog 429 substring misclassification; optionally gate #on/#off [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]clock tags on organizer_is_self per the memory decision.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Web-clip network guards and image handling[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]web-clip-guards[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]web-clip-guards: re-validate the final navigation URL and redirect chain[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]against host_is_global, block unguarded WebSocket handshakes, parse img [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]attributes positionally so data-bob-origin query strings cannot drop [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]images, and make the origin re.sub replacement literal.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Durable and race-free vault writes[/bold #D7AFFF]                            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]durable-vault-writes[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]durable-vault-writes: bind bank ensure's write-guard preimage to its [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]single planning snapshot, install clip attachments via [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]hard_link/create_new, fsync the three non-flushing atomic_write variants[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and the gkeep token write, and verify ownership of the shared-tmp [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]script-cache fallback.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Small verified fixes[/bold #D7AFFF]                                          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]small-audit-fixes[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]small-audit-fixes: prefix-match the pomodoro OVERDUE status, close the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]perl two-arg open in bob_pomodoro, report damaged albums as io instead [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]of note_changed, require FILE args on bank import, and strip migration [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]anchors by match span.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-kq","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-kq.1","reasoning_effort":"high","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"bob-cli-kq.1"},"source_run_id":"run-2ef5d823d75509ae066c022873259781","started_at":"2026-11-12T10:29:34.107848+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[{"committed_at":1794482564,"sha":"4ffa85d03376aa5747dbb10070658f1a452a56a4","subject":"fix(gcal): escape organizer title tags and links"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"9c8bb75fc3ebea5fd82d9719c25fec47b2ff6a51e694f752eeb30ed4a712328e","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-kq.2--1/chat.md","size_bytes":10255},"commits":{"digest":"cc341c7bee0b2e7a8ffc7bdf62db37df399a15fa88344dab7da57fdb919bb1de","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-kq.2--1/commits.json","size_bytes":226},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"13912bb96bb93680d946ffcb40740a58d1abcfdc43456a37f582f841f6e2c6e1","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-kq.2--1/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":67},"meta":{"digest":"3df793a0b4e459cf12c48dc6b6c94c42c785b06e0eee6fa4e9ecf7cda9193fdc","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-kq.2--1/meta.json","s